==English==
{{wikipedia|Molar concentration}}

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|molar|ity}} in the chemistry usage.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|LL-Q1860 (eng)-Flame, not lame-molarity.wav|a=US}}
* {{rhymes|en|æɹɪti|s=4}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|chemistry}} the [[concentration]] of a [[substance]] in [[solution]], expressed as the [[number]] of [[mole|moles]] of [[solute]] per [[litre]] of [[solution]]

